                          "id": "zhFWp",
                          "name": "Chat / Input Field / Empty",
                          "context": "Input Field / Empty — Shown when no text has been entered. Contains placeholder text and the button row (voice, send disabled). Outer padding: 12t/20r/20b/20l. Inner field: $g:sem-chatInputBg, border $g:sem-chatInputBorder, radius $g:radius-xs.",
