    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "l4Tsl",
      "x": 3562,
      "y": 2412,
      "name": "Theme toggle — behavior",
      "width": 340,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "Theme toggle — behavior\n\nManual toggle only — no OS prefers-color-scheme. Tap sets data-theme=\"dark\"|\"light\" on <html>; the flip is a pure token swap (no markup changes, no re-render — mounted components restyle in place, chat state preserved).\n\nPersist device-local; apply before first paint via inline script — a flash of the wrong theme is a bug, not polish. Storage blocked (private mode) → session-only in-memory toggle, no error UI.\n\nDefault theme is DARK — confirmed by the business Sep 22, 2026 (recorded in FE-1894). Canon: PRO-2757 + dark-mode-handoff/README-DEV.md; this note is a summary, those win."
    }
  ],
